{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What if you could build your own robot? What if you could poke it? Speak to it? Laugh with it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MyRobot is a robot sandbox game with a TON of character interactions; from triggering emotions to customizations to engaging NPC conversations! All wrapped with silly gameplay and AI integration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>AI is optional</strong></u>\u00a0and you can host your own AI models for <u><strong>complete privacy</strong></u>. Alternatively you can use our online AI services or mix and match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597510/extras/banner1.png?t=1745425190\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customization is super important in MyRobot and everything you change about your robot is done in an intricate manner; you cut hair with scissors, color eyelashes with pens, and change hairstyles with hair combs. Want your robot to have fangs? Use the dental tool!\ud83e\uddb7\ud83d\udc43\ud83d\udc40\ud83d\udc44\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597510/extras/banner2.png?t=1745425190\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597510?t=1745425190","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597510?t=1745425190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597510/21153092e50698a84875b7643a6df444510da3d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745425190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597510/21153092e50698a84875b7643a6df444510da3d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745425190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What if you could build your own robot? What if you could poke it? Speak to it? Laugh with it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MyRobot is a robot sandbox game with a TON of character interactions; from triggering emotions to customizations to engaging NPC conversations! All wrapped with silly gameplay and AI integration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>AI is optional</strong></u>\u00a0and you can host your own AI models for <u><strong>complete privacy</strong></u>. Alternatively you can use our online AI services or mix and match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597510/extras/banner1.png?t=1745425190\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customization is super important in MyRobot and everything you change about your robot is done in an intricate manner; you cut hair with scissors, color eyelashes with pens, and change hairstyles with hair combs. Want your robot to have fangs? Use the dental tool!\ud83e\uddb7\ud83d\udc43\ud83d\udc40\ud83d\udc44\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597510/extras/banner2.png?t=1745425190\" /></p>","developers":["sgthale"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597510/4fa3c62a42a4863612848140d7a5615fa8e5223c/header.jpg?t=1745425190","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128893,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128893/mo